u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">와 한국과학창의재단 사이언스올</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">https://www.scienceall.com/</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">을 통해 무관중 경연대회로 실시간 중계되오니 관심있는 분들의 많은 시청 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">행사명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 2020 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">페임랩 코리아 최종 본선대회</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">행사내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">대중과 소통할 수 있는 과학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">공학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">수학 분야 본인의 연구내용 혹은 연구와 관련된 내용을 주제로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">분간 발표</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">방송일시</spa